{
    "title": "Early Vote Action",
    "description": "Early Vote Action enables grassroots volunteers to GOTV. The EVA app is designed to enable dedicated conservative volunteers to do the grassroots work our party is built on! If you\u2019ve always wanted to help, download the app and start making contacts \u2014 because you never know which vote is going to decide an election.\r\n\r\nThrough this application, EVA intends to take the best activists from all fifty states and provide them with the necessary infrastructure to easily help mobilize the country in some of the most important yet often overlooked races.\r\n\r\nThe Early Vote Action app is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or representative of any government entity. It is a standalone platform that provides voting-related information and resources, independent of any official government organization.\r\n\r\n[Minimum supported app version: 1.0.20]",
